              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabishuye ibihwanye n’ukwononekara kwabo hamwe n’ivyaha vyabo, maze ndabanyegeza mu nyonga hanje.",
          "type": "text",
