        },
        {
          "text": " Nyeninganji mvuze: Ngiye gukura Yakobo mu kinyago, ngirire impuhwe ubwoko bwose bwa Isirayeli, kandi nzogirira ipfuhe izina ryanje ryera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
