          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninamara kubagarukana ndabakuye mu mahanga, nkabegeranya ndabakuye mu bihugu vy’abansi babo, nzokwerekana ukwera kwanje nciye kuri bo imbere y’amahanga menshi. ",
          "type": "text",
